{"4405240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Door at the End of the Hall", "steam_appid": 4405240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a looping hallway, you must study subtle changes to choose the right doors. Each passage resets the hall, but slightly wrong. Observe carefully, make smart choices, and uncover the path that unlocks the mysterious door at the end of the hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.poster.avif?t=1784557813\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.webm?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.mp4?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you step through a door, you find yourself back at the beginning. Something always changes. An item out of place. A detail that doesn’t belong. A feeling that the hall itself is watching to see if you notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.poster.avif?t=1784557813\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.webm?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.mp4?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Door at the End of the Hall</strong> is a first-person, 3D psychological observation/anomaly finder game where progress depends on attention, intuition, and memory. You must choose between multiple doors, using subtle environmental clues to determine which path leads you closer to escape and which ones pull you deeper into the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the far end of the hallway stands a locked  door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach it, you’ll need to understand the rules of the hall, recognize what’s wrong, and learn how your choices shape each repetition. Every pass through the corridor tests your perception, rewarding careful observation, and punishing assumptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no guessing. Every change is deterministic and can be solved. The space changes when you aren’t looking—and dares you to notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the path that finally lets you leave?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a single, complete run: ~15 - 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the post-game completionist mode: ~45m - 1hr</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in a looping hallway, you must study subtle changes to choose the right doors. Each passage resets the hall, but slightly wrong. Observe carefully, make smart choices, and uncover the path that unlocks the mysterious door at the end of the hall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.poster.avif?t=1784557813\" width=1170 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.webm?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/f2947152a4263d0e273e75f1932ef08f.mp4?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you step through a door, you find yourself back at the beginning. Something always changes. An item out of place. A detail that doesn’t belong. A feeling that the hall itself is watching to see if you notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.poster.avif?t=1784557813\" width=1170 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.webm?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/extras/61799c680a900328389d083ed2a5806c.mp4?t=1784557813\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Door at the End of the Hall</strong> is a first-person, 3D psychological observation/anomaly finder game where progress depends on attention, intuition, and memory. You must choose between multiple doors, using subtle environmental clues to determine which path leads you closer to escape and which ones pull you deeper into the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the far end of the hallway stands a locked  door. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To reach it, you’ll need to understand the rules of the hall, recognize what’s wrong, and learn how your choices shape each repetition. Every pass through the corridor tests your perception, rewarding careful observation, and punishing assumptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no guessing. Every change is deterministic and can be solved. The space changes when you aren’t looking—and dares you to notice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you find the path that finally lets you leave?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Estimated Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a single, complete run: ~15 - 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including the post-game completionist mode: ~45m - 1hr</p>", "short_description": "Trapped in a looping hallway, you must study subtle changes to choose the right doors. Each passage resets the hall, but slightly wrong. Observe carefully, make smart choices, and uncover the path that unlocks the mysterious door at the end of the hall.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/497553bf8e3cf62927d828ac64d0e65a774409fa/header.jpg?t=1784557813", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/33ca05dc964e225b611812e922e64b7880ec7d35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784557813", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4405240/33ca05dc964e225b611812e922e64b7880ec7d35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784557813", "website": "https://renolc.games/games/the-door-at-the-end-of-the-hall", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X / Intel UHD 630<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1